msgid "Why import a library?"
msgstr "Per què importar una biblioteca?"

#: cms/templates/import.html:210
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You might want to update an existing library to a new version, or replace an"
" existing library entirely. You might also have developed a library outside "
"of {studio_name}."
msgstr ""
"Potser vols actualitzar una biblioteca existent a una nova versió, o "
"substituir completament una biblioteca existent. També és possible que hagis"
